  abilityName: Winter's Flight Home
  abilityDesc: 17 combo powerful Light attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP), hugely boosts Atk, Def, Rec for 3 turns, enormously boosts critical hit
    rate for 3 turns, hugely boosts Atk relative to Def for 3 turns, hugely boosts
    all elemental damage for 3 turns, critical and elemental vulnerability infliction
    for 2 turns & probability of activating BB/SBB/UBB twice for 2 turns
